 "stimulus_html": "<figure id=\"fig7_40\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/2a6b00d196aee432.png\" alt=\"Image of a ballot, with names and positions listed. The ballot reads “K. N. Ticket. For supreme judge—Shepard F. Norris. For member of board of public works—Alexander P. Miller. For congress—Dr. G. V. Dorsey. For auditor—Andrew Waucop. For probate judge—Vincent Guerin. For clerk of court of common pleas—Jonathan Counts. For commissioner—William Mellinger. For prosecuting attorney—Hugh Thompson. Eternal hostility to Foreign and Roman Catholic influence! Each voter will keep his ticket concealed—let no one see it—and be careful to tear off the top and bottom before depositing it in the ballot box.\">\n<figcaption>A ballot from 1855.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
